                <div id="intro" class="mb-5 pb-4 border-bottom border-secondary border-opacity-20">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                        <div class="rounded-circle bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3 font-weight-extrabold fs-5" style="width: 42px; height: 42px;">
                            A
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-white font-weight-bold mb-0" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">Platform Introduction</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3" style="font-size: 1.02rem;">
                        <strong><span class="notranslate" translate="no"><span style="color: #ff6b00;">Raah</span><span class="text-white">Sathi</span></span></strong> operates strictly as an emergency roadside assistance marketplace and technology aggregator platform connecting vehicle drivers stranded on highways or city locations ("Customers") with nearby independent, KYC-verified automotive patrol technicians and workshops ("Mechanics" or "Service Providers").
                    </p>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-dark bg-opacity-60 border-start border-4 border-warning rounded-end text-muted small">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-warning me-2"></i>
                        <strong>Important Clarification:</strong> <span class="notranslate" translate="no"><span style="color: #ff6b00;">Raah</span><span class="text-white">Sathi</span></span> provides software algorithms, GPS dispatch routing, transparent pricing estimation, and Escrow payment facilitation. <span class="notranslate" translate="no"><span style="color: #ff6b00;">Raah</span><span class="text-white">Sathi</span></span> itself does not own auto workshops nor directly employ mechanics as garage staff.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- SECTION B: User Eligibility -->
                <div id="eligibility" class="mb-5 pb-4 border-bottom border-secondary border-opacity-20">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                        <div class="rounded-circle bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3 font-weight-extrabold fs-5" style="width: 42px; height: 42px;">
                            B
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-white font-weight-bold mb-0" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">User Eligibility</h3>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="text-muted leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <li><strong>Age Requirement:</strong> You must be at least 18 years of age or older and possess legal authority to enter into binding agreements under Indian Laws.</li>
                        <li><strong>Accurate Registration:</strong> Users must provide truthful, current, and complete registration details (Full Name, Active Mobile Number, Vehicle Registration, and valid ID). Providing fraudulent or impersonated identities is strictly prohibited.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- SECTION C: Mechanic Responsibilities -->
