                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                        <div class="rounded-circle bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-3 font-weight-extrabold fs-5" style="width: 42px; height: 42px;">
                            C
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-white font-weight-bold mb-0" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">Mechanic Responsibilities</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-3">All independent partner mechanics registered on RaahSathi must adhere strictly to platform service level standards:</p>
                    <div class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="p-3 bg-dark bg-opacity-40 border border-secondary border-opacity-30 rounded-3 h-100">
                                <h6 class="text-warning font-weight-bold mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card me-2"></i> Document Verification</h6>
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Must submit government-issued Aadhaar Card, Driving License, Workshop Registration, and Bank Account details for mandatory KYC verification before accepting jobs.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="p-3 bg-dark bg-opacity-40 border border-secondary border-opacity-30 rounded-3 h-100">
                                <h6 class="text-warning font-weight-bold mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check me-2"></i> Standard Pricing Compliance</h6>
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Must honor system-calculated 2-Layer pricing rates. Demand for unauthorized cash tips or inflated off-app surcharges will result in immediate termination.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="p-3 bg-dark bg-opacity-40 border border-secondary border-opacity-30 rounded-3 h-100">
                                <h6 class="text-warning font-weight-bold mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear me-2"></i> Professional Conduct</h6>
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Must maintain respectful, professional behavior with customers, wear proper safety gear, and ensure honest automotive diagnostic practices.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="p-3 bg-dark bg-opacity-40 border border-secondary border-opacity-30 rounded-3 h-100">
                                <h6 class="text-warning font-weight-bold mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-ban me-2"></i> Prohibition of Illicit Acts</h6>
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Strict zero-tolerance policy against theft, replacement of genuine vehicle parts with counterfeit items, or participating in any illegal activities.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- SECTION D: Customer Responsibilities -->
