                        <li><strong>Accurate Breakdown Location:</strong> Customer must share precise GPS breakdown coordinates, landmark details, and remain reachable on phone during dispatch.</li>
                        <li><strong>Vehicle Specification:</strong> Provide exact vehicle make, model, fuel type (Petrol/Diesel/EV), and breakdown description to ensure dispatch of appropriate tools.</li>
                        <li><strong>Timely Settlement:</strong> Make complete, punctual payment of generated digital invoices upon job completion.</li>
                        <li><strong>No Fake or Hoax Requests:</strong> Submitting fake emergency requests, pranks, or abandoning breakdown spots without cancelling is punishable under platform rules.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

