                    </div>
                    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3">
                        <span class="notranslate" translate="no"><span style="color: #ff6b00;">Raah</span><span class="text-white">Sathi</span></span> operates on a transparent 2-Layer Pricing System designed to prevent highway exploitation:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="text-muted leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <li><strong>Layer 1 (Visiting &amp; Distance Charge):</strong> Base fee + per-KM distance rate calculated automatically from the mechanic's location to breakdown point.</li>
                        <li><strong>Physical On-Site Inspection:</strong> The initial estimated charge covers diagnostic inspection &amp; basic assistance. If physical breakdown inspection reveals additional internal faults (e.g. clutch overhaul, alternator failure, spare part replacement):
                            <ul>
                                <li>The mechanic will update the digital job quote on the app.</li>
                                <li><strong>Mandatory Customer Approval:</strong> Extra repairs will ONLY commence after the customer explicitly reviews and approves the updated price estimate on the app screen.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>
                        <li><strong>No Surcharges on Customers:</strong> <span class="notranslate" translate="no"><span style="color: #ff6b00;">Raah</span><span class="text-white">Sathi</span></span> does NOT charge hidden customer convenience fees or extra commission markup on top of approved invoice rates.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

