                    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3" style="font-size: 1.02rem;">
                        <strong>Role Clarity Notice:</strong> <span class="notranslate" translate="no"><span style="color: #ff6b00;">Raah</span><span class="text-white">Sathi</span></span> is a digital technology platform that facilitates connections between vehicle drivers and independent service providers.
