                    <ul class="text-muted leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <li><strong>Workmanship &amp; Parts Responsibility:</strong> Repair quality, durability of spare parts fitted on-site, and physical mechanical workmanship are the primary responsibility of the dispatched service provider/mechanic.</li>
                        <li><strong><span class="notranslate" translate="no"><span style="color: #ff6b00;">Raah</span><span class="text-white">Sathi</span></span> Protection Guarantee:</strong> While primary workmanship rests with the mechanic, <span class="notranslate" translate="no"><span style="color: #ff6b00;">Raah</span><span class="text-white">Sathi</span></span> actively protects customers by verifying mechanic credentials, facilitating Escrow hold security, and maintaining a dedicated 24×7 Dispute Resolution Desk to inspect claims and enforce refunds where service falls short.</li>
