                        <div class="col-md-6"><div class="p-2.5 bg-dark bg-opacity-40 border border-secondary border-opacity-20 rounded"><i class="fa-solid fa-comment-slash text-danger me-2"></i> Abusive behavior, threats, or harassment</div></div>
                        <div class="col-md-6"><div class="p-2.5 bg-dark bg-opacity-40 border border-secondary border-opacity-20 rounded"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-excel text-danger me-2"></i> Submission of forged or fake KYC documents</div></div>
                        <div class="col-md-6"><div class="p-2.5 bg-dark bg-opacity-40 border border-secondary border-opacity-20 rounded"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-dollar text-danger me-2"></i> Non-payment or short-payment of service invoices</div></div>
