                        <i class="fa-solid fa-headset text-warning me-1"></i> 24×7 Legal Desk: <a href="mailto:legal@raahsathi.in" class="text-warning text-decoration-none">legal@raahsathi.in</a> | Toll-Free: <strong>1800-102-7224</strong>
